File names: ORCMSLMC.MP, SLMCORCM.MP
Path description: To and from Orc Mansion and Slum Crossroads
Path starts: Orc Mansion and Slum Crossroads
Path ends: Orc Mansion and Slum Crossroads
Area of the game: Original Game
Level recommendation: N/A
File format: New
Type of path: Path

Additional Information:

Without these paths, Megamud will backtrack to the Western Door
anytime you walk between Silvermere and the Orc Mansion.  These
two paths will avoid this, and save about 20 steps each way.

Author:  Salacious Crumb (salacious.crumb@dgpi.com)
